    "description": "Natural Specimen\nPolished Blue Agate Geode\nNatural Agate and Druzy Quartz\nApprox. 5.5\" H x 4\" W x 2\" D\nUnsigned\nThis striking geological specimen features a vibrant, deep blue agate body with a brilliant white druzy quartz crystalline center. The face and sides have been professionally polished to a high-gloss finish, revealing the intricate banding and depth of the stone, while the back remains in its raw, natural state. The rich teal-blue hue highlights the natural crystalline structures within the central cavity, creating a dramatic decorative piece suitable for modern or naturalist interiors.\nFeatures a prominent central druzy cavity with sparkling translucent quartz crystals\nSubstantial weight of 2.4 lbs makes it ideal for use as a single bookend or paperweight\nFlat-sawn base and sides allow for stable upright display on shelves or mantels\nPolished surface showcases fine concentric banding typical of high-quality agate\nCondition:\nVery good condition with a high-luster polish on the primary surfaces. As a natural geological item, it contains inherent pits, fissures, and variations in texture and color that are characteristic of the medium. The base shows minor shelf wear consistent with display, but the polished faces remain smooth and vibrant.\nMerchandise is sold As Is. Returns will only be accepted with prior authorization and under the terms stated in this Return Policy. If you have questions regarding the quality or authenticity of this item please contact Goodwill of Silicon Valley at 408-869-9262 prior to placing your bid. Items may be returned within seven (7) days of receipt if the merchandise was damaged during shipping or if there was a major distortion in the description. Returns will not be accepted without prior authorization. PLEASE NOTE THAT WE DO NOT REFUND SHIPPING AND HANDLING\nCHARGES. Items selected for pick up from the seller, must be picked up within thirty (30) days from close of auction. Items not picked up from seller within thirty (30) days from close of auction will be resold with no further\nnotice.\nLocal Pickup Policy\nAll items must be picked up within 30 days of purchase.\nAny item not picked up within 30 days of purchase will be resold without any prior notification.\nAll items picked up must be picked up by the individual named in the profile.\nNo 3rd party pickups without prior approval.\nIdentification is required to be shown when picking up all orders\nPayment for items not picked up within 30 days of purchase will be refunded automatically.\nAll pick-up orders must be paid for prior to pick-up. Payments will not be accepted on-site - no exceptions.\nNo Walk-Ins.\nIf you have not scheduled and received a confirmation of your pick up time, we will not be able to accommodate your pick up. Local pickup must be scheduled prior to arrival by calling Customer Service at 408-869-9262.\nThe pickup address for all items is 1600 Technology Drive, San Jose, CA 95110\nLocal pickup is available by appointment only and must be picked up within 30 days.",
